---

<section class="close" id="inscripcion">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span>Inscripción abierta</span>
      <h2>Coge tu<br />plaza</h2>
      <p>Solo 48 equipos. Cuando se llenan, se llenan. Rellena los datos y guardamos tu sitio.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="form reveal">
      <div class="field">
        <label for="team">Nombre del equipo</label>
        <input id="team" name="team" type="text" placeholder="Los Vasos Voladores" autocomplete="off" required />
      </div>
      <div class="row2">
        <div class="field">
          <label for="p1">Participante 1</label>
          <input id="p1" name="p1" type="text" placeholder="Nombre y apellido" autocomplete="off" required />
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label for="p2">Participante 2</label>
          <input id="p2" name="p2" type="text" placeholder="Nombre y apellido" autocomplete="off" required />
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="field">
        <label for="tel">Teléfono de contacto</label>
        <input id="tel" name="tel" type="tel" inputmode="tel" placeholder="600 123 456" autocomplete="tel" required />
      </div>
      <button class="submit" type="button">Reservar plaza →</button>
      <p class="fineprint">Pago por Bizum al confirmar · Quedan 6 de 48 plazas</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .close {
    background: var(--cup);
    color: var(--cream);
    padding: 96px 0;
  }

  .close .eyebrow {
    color: var(--cream);
  }

  .close .eyebrow .dot {
    background: var(--cream);
  }

  .close h2 {
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 8vw, 6rem);
    line-height: 0.9;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin: 16px 0 0;
  }

  .close p {
    max-width: 44ch;
    margin-top: 16px;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--cream);
  }

  .form {
    margin-top: 38px;
    max-width: 560px;
    display: grid;
    gap: 14px;
  }

  .form .field {
    display: grid;
    gap: 6px;
  }

  .form label {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--cream);
  }

  .form input {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 1rem;
    padding: 14px 16px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    border: 2px solid rgba(23, 14, 17, 0.35);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
    color: var(--night);
  }

  .form input::placeholder {
    color: rgba(23, 14, 17, 0.55);
  }

  .form input:focus {
    outline: none;
    border-color: var(--night);
    background: #fff;
  }

  .form .row2 {
    display: grid;
    gap: 14px;
  }

  @media (min-width: 560px) {
    .form .row2 {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }
  }

  .form .submit {
    margin-top: 6px;
    background: var(--night);
    color: var(--cream);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    padding: 16px;
    border-radius: 100px;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-family: var(--sans);
    transition: transform 0.15s ease;
  }

  .form .submit:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .fineprint {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: var(--cream);
    margin-top: 16px;
  }
</style>
